CM_ SG_ 611 VCRIGHT_cdpRequestState "If the Electronic Parking Brake makes a Controlled Deceleration for Parking Brake request, when cdpOkayToRequest is EPB_CDP_REQUEST_INVALID, cdpRequestState shall transition to EPB_CDP_REQUEST_INVALID, untill the Electronic Parking Brake Monitor enters unitStatus PARKED. Stability Control listens to this signal to qualify Controlled Deceleration for Parking Brake requests from the Electronic Parking Brake.";
